== Impact from stats ==

Wisdom is the best attribute for Druids and recommended for new players. 

== Religion ==

All Wood Elf druids must worship Tunare, while all Halflings must worship Karana.  Half-Elves and Humans can choose between the two.

Both Tunare and Karana have deity-specific tailored armor that is useful for skilling tailoring to 200 or beyond. Velious has several Tunare-only quests. Both deities are good and will be KOS in most evil places.

